  "body": "An exclusive collection of newly completed freehold residences, thoughtfully designed for contemporary family living in one of Mairangi Bay's most coveted locations. \r\n\r\nWhile each home offers its own distinctive floor plan, interior palette and design nuances, all deliver generous bedroom accommodation, beautifully appointed interiors, oversized wardrobes, options of double or single garaging and an uncompromising standard of craftsmanship. Perfectly positioned opposite Mairangi Bay Park and just a five-minute stroll from the beach and vibrant village, the lifestyle on offer is as compelling as the homes themselves. Morning walks along the coastline, weekends at the tennis club or golf course, and coffee at your favourite local café are all within easy reach. Families will value the convenience of zoning for Mairangi Bay School, Murrays Bay Intermediate, Rangitoto College and Westlake Girls High School.\r\n\r\nConstructed with enduring quality and backed by a 10-Year Master Build Guarantee, these residences present an exceptional opportunity to secure a brand-new home in an address where lifestyle, longevity and location are seamlessly aligned.\r\n\r\nSOLD Lot 1: approx. 160m² floor area on 156m² of land\r\n\r\nAVAILABLE Lot 2: approx. 160m² floor area on 143m² of land\r\n\r\nAVAILABLE Lot 3: approx. 160.8m² floor area on 157m² of land\r\n\r\nAVAILABLE Lot 4: approx. 186.7m² floor area on 169m² of land\r\n\r\nAVAILABLE Lot 5: approx. 214m² floor area on 136m² of land\r\n\r\nSOLD Lot 6: approx. 214m² floor area on 164m² of land \r\n\r\nNote: Photography shown is of Lot 5, the floorplan and design varies between units. Please contact Harry for more information.",
